    <name><text>NEET_UG_BIOLOGY_CH11_DIAGRAM_Q06 - Sparged stirred-tank bioreactor oxygen transfer</text></name>
    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[
      <p>The diagram below shows a sparged stirred-tank bioreactor in which sterile air is sparged through the culture medium. How does this sparging mechanism improve large-scale aerobic culturing?</p>
      <p>
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 260" width="360" height="260">
          <rect x="10" y="10" width="340" height="240" rx="8" fill="#f8fafc" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1.5"/>
