    <answer fraction="100" format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>The air bubbles dramatically increase the surface area for oxygen transfer into the culture medium.</p>]]></text></answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Gas entrainment at the surface completely eliminates the need for an agitator or impeller.</p>]]></text></answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Air bubbles maintain constant broth temperature without requiring a temperature control system.</p>]]></text></answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Sparging directly precipitates the recombinant protein for immediate downstream processing.</p>]]></text></answer>
